@model FootballRules

@* Shown on a playbook, a formation or a play of the game the team is not playing now.
   The model is the game the playbook was drawn for. *@
@{
    var gameNow = Model == FootballRules.American ? FootballRules.Canadian : FootballRules.American;
}
<div class="alert alert-secondary" role="status">
    This belongs to the playbooks for @DisplayText.Rules(Model), which are put away while the team plays @DisplayText.Rules(gameNow).
    It can be read here but not changed, and it is not listed under Playbook.
    The head coach can change the game back in the team's settings.
</div>
